## Validation Checklist

- [ ] No resource IDs change after state mv (check `terraform state show module.app["dev"].aws_eks_cluster.app`)
- [ ] Plan shows zero changes before first apply
- [ ] Both dev and prod deploy independently (`-var-file=dev.tfvars` vs. `-var-file=prod.tfvars`)
- [ ] State file is smaller (less duplication)
- [ ] Module is reusable; can add environments by adding to `for_each` set

This approach ensures **infrastructure continuity** while eliminating duplication.
